    *- [ENH] [TI-0089] Evaluate transcript and summary quality
      [DESC] Measure transcript errors, missed decisions, invented actions, wrong owners, and invalid evidence.
    *- [ENH] [TI-0090] Exercise endurance and interruption recovery
